cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Basin-conditioned soft physics for LSTM streamflow prediction"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the per-basin training code for a pre-registered
  test of attribute-conditioned soft physical constraints for LSTM streamflow
  prediction under simulated gauge outages: the LSTM, seven soft-physics
  penalties and a smoothness control, the basin-attribute weighting, contiguous
  outage masks, and a command-line entry point with a synthetic-data smoke test.
keywords:
  - physics-informed machine learning
  - streamflow prediction
  - LSTM
  - missing data
  - hydrology
authors:
  - family-names: Gebre
    given-names: Tewodros Syum
    orcid: 0000-0002-6355-0916
